From beb39b2fa9abb31fe9341077be49bbef22595def Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: git: harden fetched ref integration

Reuse canonical fetched-ref iteration and raw-fetch plumbing, normalize
object IDs, preserve accurate cleanup errors, report merged ref
conflicts, and avoid shallow-index rebuilds for order-only changes.

